Date: Thu, 15 May 2025 09:36:53 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] configurations: mtmitchell: update Min Max values

Update Min Max values calculated follow value per
hardware recommendation

Tested:
 1. Boot up and login to the OpenBmc console.
 2. Execution commands to get IPMI SEL and redfish
    SEL of threshold event
    $ ipmitool sensor get <Sensor_Name>
    $ <bmc_ip>/redfish/v1/Systems/system/LogServices/EventLog/Entries
 3. Check value and compare value of IPMI and Redfish

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Huy Anh Le <hule@amperecomputing.com>
